Subdomain StudentTranscript of StudentAcademicRecord
    documentation "A student transcript contains information about course-level grades and credits. A student transcript consists of aStudentAcademicRecord associated with each Session which has a CourseTranscript for each course taken."
    domain item Course
    domain item CourseTranscript
    domain item Session
    domain item Student
    domain item StudentAcademicRecord
    position 1

